{"h":"<p>还在用姿态洗图？KREA2完美图生图方案，堪比1比1复刻，千问+KREA2完美搭配</p><p>和姿态参考相比，它的优势是对提示词不敏感，反而越详细越好，甚至可以不写提示词。</p><p>并且可以可以编辑原图，通过修改KREA2提示词增加画面细节。</p><p>工作流参考B站UP的教程：<a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xvK56TEye\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xvK56TEye</a></p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/659e665e866533f5.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/368780139423706b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/06fcae60feb23bb8.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/df7fc9668116f176.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/7e0304fa6d43f5ae.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/4dee58755d4c5c0d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/cbc4c422ef6c8c69.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>","lang":"zh","v":2,"o":"[object Object]"}